    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, our firm is looking to move away from SMS-based MFA because of the interception risks. Can you put together a step-by-step guide for us to implement hardware security keys (like Yubikeys) across the whole office? We need to know about the deployment process and how to handle onboarding for the staff.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To implement hardware security keys, I'd recommend the following steps:\n\nStart by assessing your current infrastructure, identifying devices that support Yubikeys, and planning for any necessary upgrades. Implement a YubiKey deployment strategy, such as rolling out keys to key personnel or teams first. Develop a staff onboarding process, including training sessions, email support, and FAQs, to help staff with initial setup and troubleshooting. Many vendors, like YubiKey, also provide onboarding resources and technical support to help with deployment. A phased rollout across departments should also be considered to ensure a smooth transition.",
